WEBVTT

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:33.780
Everybody at work is very nice.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:36.030
Well, almost everyone...

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:39.820
My name is Saito Nagisa.
I am afraid of Squid Girl.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:44.830
<b>Focus your tentacles on her!</b>

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:47.790
I'm off now.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:51.130
I was lucky that the squid
person wasn't here today.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.130
Why couldn't it be like
this every day?

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.970
Oh hey, Nagisa,
are you free after this?

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.720
You should come over for dinner.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.050
Really, are you sure?

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.580
We haven't thrown you a
welcome party yet, either...

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.760
So how about it?

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:05.300
Well, the squid person isn't here...

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.600
Thank you, I'd be very
happy to join you!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:12.270
I'm home.
I brought Nagisa with me.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.110
Welcome.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.850
Good evening. Thanks for having me.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.710
Would you mind waiting in that
room until everything's ready?

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.200
This way!

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.710
Why is the squid person here?!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.880
Could this house be...

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:44.750
Nagisa, you must be thinking,
"Why is the squidvader here?!"

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.850
"She must be plotting
something evil!"

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.350
How did you know?!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:55.200
Squid Girlie came here early to
help with the party preparations.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:58.360
Darn you, Takeru,
that was unnecessary.

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.960
I'll go get some drinks!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.370
Um, so that's why you
weren't at work today?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.530
That's just an excuse.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:17.000
In reality I was preparing everything for my
exsquidsite plan that I've been perfecting until now.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:20.510
What?! A perfect plan?!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.020
That's right.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.430
I will put it into motion
after you go home.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.970
What are you planning to do?

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.310
Oops, I can't tell you any more.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.810
Hey, we're ready!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.940
Finally, I couldn't wait
much longer!

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:40.730
Look at her face.
But I won't be deceived.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.950
Nagisa, I look forward to
continuing to work with you.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.260
Hear hear!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.040
I look forward to working
with you, too.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.470
Don't hold back; eat as
much as you want.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.750
Chizuru's croquettes
are really yummy.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.590
Such a happy family...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.220
I can't let this be destroyed
by the hands of the squid person!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.380
Is something wrong, Nagisa?

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:05.360
You look so serious.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.970
The toilet's that way.

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.390
Please let me stay over tonight!

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:13.110
Huh? Tonight? That's
kind of sudden.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.060
Well, it's okay with me.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.520
I am going to protect them!

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:21.940
Good night.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.320
Good squidly night.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.660
I have to stay up and see
what she's plotting.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:31.720
Squii... squii...

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:34.640
Already?! No, this might
be part of her plan,

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:35.620
I mustn't let my guard down.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:42.420
Squii... squii... squii...

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.180
It's been about three hours now.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.350
The squid person is finally
making her move.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.270
I have to stop her!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.420
A video game.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.590
Good morning.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.290
Looks like you didn't get
enough sleep, Nagisa.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.880
I guess with Squid Girl in the room

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.850
you couldn't really relax, huh?

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.980
Why are you sleepy, too?

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.320
You're just imagining that.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.570
Isn't it because you were gaming?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.200
You!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.620
I told you not to play
games at night!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.790
How the squid did you find out?

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:54.120
Nagisa, that was quite bold
of you to uncover my secret!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.170
I'll get my revenge, squid pro quo.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:06:01.880
Stop worrying about Nagisa
and go wash your face.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:06.820
Yeah, why does she always
pay so much attention to me?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:07.670
Last time, too...

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.800
Nagisa is my prey!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.070
As far as I know,
nobody is afraid of the squid person.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.020
You could even go as far
as to say they're friends.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.610
If this is how the squid
person does things,

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.990
I'm unnecessary, since
I don't fit the mold!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:27.900
What's more, I am actually a
danger to the squid person.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.660
The fact that she's paying
attention to me means...

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:34.160
I'm her target.

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:37.720
If I'm dead, I won't be
able to do anything.

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:40.750
I'll pretend that I'm not
afraid for a while.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:47.680
If you don't work hard,
I'll cut you to pieces with my tentacles!

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.130
Hey, Squid Girl!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:53.260
Oh, please stop the
bad jokes, Ms. Squid Girl.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.470
M-Ms. Squid Girl?!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:59.260
Uh, you aren't afraid
of her anymore?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.810
Yeah,there's no reason
to pretend you're not.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.820
I'm not pretending.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:07.030
Don't worry, I'm not
afraid anymore.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.230
I see, you've finally overcome it.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.870
Well, then get along, you two.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.430
I wonder if I fooled them...

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.600
Hey, wait! Squid Girl!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:32.270
Was it such a big shock that Nagisa
isn't scared any more?

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.180
I think it's not bad to have an invader
who's accepted by everybody.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.630
You like Nagisa, right?

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.810
Don't you think that being avoided
by someone you like is really sad?

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:50.090
It might be...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.280
Okay.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.350
You can be nice to Nagisa, right?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.700
Then let's go back!

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.140
I'm sorry for scaring you until now.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:07.250
Let's shake tentacles and be friendly
towards each other from now on!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.380
I'm sorry! I just can't do it!

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:21.320
I really was still afraid of you!
Please forgive me!

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.500
What the squid am
I supposed to do?

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:32.540
Stay the same, I guess?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.320
Come on, it's just going to the lab.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.650
No squidding way!

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.460
I just want to look at
your insides a bit.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.820
Do you realize how
scary that sounds?

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:48.450
You have to try everything
at least once.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.200
I know that I do NOT have
to squidly try that!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.840
Who is she?

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:58.550
I am Cindy Campbell, a professional
of anti-alien countermeasures.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.390
Aliens?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.370
I am going to get you
to my lab today!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.960
Wait!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.360
This country is doomed.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:14.360
<b>Feeling inkuisitive?</b>

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.360
I am Squid Girl, the messenger
from the sea.

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:27.370
I should be respected more
as the messenger.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.580
Squid Girlie, let's play!

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:34.420
I'm not Squid Girlie.
From today, you shall call me Squid Queen.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.580
You're my undersquid
from now on.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:38.970
Why aren't you groveling!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.930
I don't quite get it,
but I guess I'll play along.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:47.950
My apologies. Your wish is
my command, my Queen.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:51.510
Takeru's good, he just gets it.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.030
Squid Gi- I mean- Your Highness?

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:55.450
What is it?

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.530
Are there more undersquids
besides me?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.240
There's one!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:04.840
Hey, Goro. Wanna hand
over that seat to me?

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:06.750
Huh? Of course not.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.000
Secret photos of Chizuru.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:10.750
How did you?!

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:13.130
I knew you were taking them.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.580
I bet they're hidden
in the clos...

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:19.010
Stop! I got it, I got it!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.760
Don't worry about it.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.480
Goro's kinda timid today...

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:28.600
My next undersquid's going to
be Nagisa. And who else...

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.060
I will be one!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:32.350
You're still here?

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:34.010
Yes, my Queen.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:37.850
From this moment on, I will
be your loyal servant!

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:41.720
If you insist, I suppose I can
make you my undersquid.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.250
In return, please promise
me one thing.

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.540
What is it?

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:47.750
Come to my lab.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.710
Queen

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.710
Same as before

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.710
All right.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.170
You're my undersquid from now on.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.130
Thank you, Your Highness.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.490
Now, get on your knees
and lick my feet.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:05.550
R-Really?

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:06.920
As you wish.

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:08.580
Hey, Squid Girl!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.500
So this is where you're
wasting time.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.150
How dare you! Apprehend her!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.330
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.110
Please don't take it personally, Ms. Aizawa.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.530
She's my undersquid.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.520
Undersquid? What are
you talking about?

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:29.910
This is payback for your
constant aggressions!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.580
Stop, I can't breath! Not there!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:37.440
If you want me to stop,
become my undersquid.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.680
You idiot! Think about it!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:41.500
If there are no humans left

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.160
who are your equal,
you'll really be alone!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.160
My chance!

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.610
Ow. That hurt!

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:51.480
I don't have time to play along
with your foolishness.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.210
We're going back to work.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:55.310
Wait, what about the promise?

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.220
Promise?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:03.330
I didn't think that I'd really
have to squidding go.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.240
You have to keep your promises.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.900
You can see it now.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.750
Wow, that's quite impressive.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.160
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:15.730
What the heck is this?

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:17.010
This is inkredible.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.210
Yeah, it's amazing.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.190
Cindy, is that the Squidian?

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:25.300
I'm not a Squidian.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.930
Can you get in here for a second?

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:39.420
I was almost smoked in there!

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:41.400
That's dangerous!

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.030
What now?

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:49.160
Can I test it? It's an energy
weapon against aliens.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.650
Help me!

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.240
Stop it, you two.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.500
I promised that I would just
show her around today.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.650
How sad...

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.670
But we can still inspect her, right?

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.520
What is it with these people?!

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:05.590
Let me introduce you.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.840
Harris leads the experiments.

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:10.050
Clark is the head inventor.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.220
Martin is head of research.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.470
And I lead the investigation.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:21.110
We're all top-of-the-class graduates from
MIT; the best alien researchers.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.570
Wait, so that's all the researchers?

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.560
Quality over quantity.

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:30.370
So you must have all sorts of secret
information about aliens.

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:33.840
Not yet...

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.660
Why the squid are you
looking at me?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.030
We wish we could actually
do something,

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:42.050
in case an alien shows up,
so we ended up overdoing the prep-work.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.440
While creating a device that
can put aliens to sleep,

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.760
we stumbled upon a device
that can cure cancer.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:51.970
And an energy weapon that can
shrink and expand matter.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.510
While researching how to communicate
with the aliens,

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.970
we stumbled upon a method
that allows you to instantly

00:13:57.970 --> 00:13:59.440
learn all the languages of the world...

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.780
What a waste of talent.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.480
Wouldn't it make a lot more sense

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.480
to pursue another career,
when you're so good?

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:09.410
Young ladies, you don't
get it, do you?

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:14.460
We don't need anything else
if we can just study aliens.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.340
We don't desire money;
all we want is our dream!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:23.160
So please, pretend to be an
alien and let us study you!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.170
So you have a dream, but no pride?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.470
They're tired of waiting, too.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:31.850
No matter what your circumstances
are, I won't be an alien!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.930
I am proud to be a squid!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.640
Then let's do it this way.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.950
Please repeat the following
words ten times.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.440
"You are an alien."

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.330
Go!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:51.780
You are an alien. You are an alien.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:52.960
You are...

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:53.740
An alien!

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:55.500
Woohoo!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.490
We have finally achieved something great!
We've encountered an alien!

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.260
I recorded it loud and clear.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.260
An alien.

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:03.420
Woohoo!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.670
This is just unfair!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.080
Are you in kindergarten?

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.780
There go the three stooges again.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:09.920
Who are you to talk?

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.690
It's my squidly turn then.

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.480
Give me 10 reps of
"You are my undersquid."

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.090
Go!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:22.980
You are my undersquid. You are my undersquid.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:23.900
You are...

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:24.520
Harris.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.270
Clark.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:25.940
Martin.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.120
Did you really think that we,

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.050
who graduated MIT top of the
class, would fall for that?

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.960
That trick only works on idiots.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.420
That's something I don't want to hear
from idiotic space nerds like you!

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.610
We haven't been doing
so well lately.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.570
We gotta do something about that.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.570
Hey, what are you up to?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.250
You're really cute.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.180
That's one of Goro's lifeguard buddies.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:53.970
Do you have some time?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:53.970
Oh, yeah.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.970
How about having lunch together?

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.040
What the hell?!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.420
You're bothering her!

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.320
Don't just blindly hit on
anything that moves!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.720
Sorry about that.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.610
Oh, I think I've seen you before...

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.550
You're from the "South Wind"!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.150
Who?

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:15.340
You really are cute.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:18.580
Do you want to join us for tea?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.950
Hey, you're hitting on
her just the same!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:26.460
<b>A squiddle work never killed anyone.</b>

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.300
I've been wanting to talk to
you in a normal setting.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.180
You're working at the
South Wind, right?

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.790
Is that guy your dad?

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:40.260
It must be tough to always
have to wear that stuff.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.760
You get sick of it, huh?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.060
I don't want to steal you,

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.500
but do you feel like giving
working here a try?

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.390
You can say "no",
if you don't want to.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.040
All right, looks good!

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:59.030
You're plenty cute even without
the bathing suit.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.340
Well, good luck then.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.930
Looks like they hired
someone new.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:07.930
Yeah...

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:10.600
The squid girl is cute in
this refreshing way,

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:13.340
but this one has that something...

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:15.760
I heard that a really cute
girl started here.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.180
What, really?

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:20.950
Two beers.

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:21.990
For us, too.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:25.180
Why am I working my
tentacles off today?

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:27.990
Here you go: two fried noodles.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:30.700
We wanted the other
girl to bring it...

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:37.240
What are these longing looks?

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:39.510
Looks like our plan worked.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.870
I would like to have
her on our side.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.860
I'd like a beer, too.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:44.700
Coming right up.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.760
You're the South Wind's owner!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:49.870
Hey. Looks like you're quite busy.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.690
Of course.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.980
She's this cute.

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.610
You don't need that fake Squid Girl
costume to bring in the guests.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:59.140
Her natural looks are
totally sufficient.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:03.600
You should stop forcing your
poor daughter to wear that.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.310
Let me ask you this:

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.820
has she looked you in the
face a single time?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.670
She wears it voluntarily.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.360
She says that it's easier to interact with
people when she wears something.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.180
Is that true?

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:22.760
That costume exists because there
are merits for both parties involved.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.960
There are way more demerits,
no matter how you look at it.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.680
However, as a parent I do want her
to be able to talk to people.

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.380
So it's okay for her to work here.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.630
I do have a condition though.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.320
I'll borrow Squid Girl in exchange.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.220
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:43.350
In terms of sales...

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.390
She's way ahead of Squid
Girl at this point.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:51.370
So, good luck over there.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.820
Eiko, you monster!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:59.650
Why does this happen?

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:03.990
Stop dilly-dallying.
You need to liven up! Got that?!

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.720
He sounds pretty strict.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.580
What kind of work is he
going to force on me?

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.790
Time to work, Squid Girl.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:12.680
Wh-what should I do?

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:14.000
Stand there!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:15.960
Huh?

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.680
He told me to stand here, but...

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.460
How is it? Have you
gotten used to it?

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.630
I've been standing here
for about 30 minutes now...

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.640
Isn't there a single squidly
thing I should be doing?

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:34.120
A shop's hostess should
just stand in front

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.080
of the store like they're
supposed to!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.720
Well, I guess not doing anything
is easy enough.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.770
Who said you could sit?!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:43.100
I told you to stand,
you hear? Stand!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.570
Inker.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:49.370
I don't get it. Just standing
here isn't work.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.650
Ice cream? Does anybody want ice cream?

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.530
That's it!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.710
Everybody! Come to the house
at the sea, "South Wind"!

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.620
Don't call people in without
my permission!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:19:59.670
What?

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:03.470
I got yelled at for trying to attract
customers, I don't get it.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.610
We're full right now.

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:08.340
It would be rude to make
the customers wait.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.060
You could have squidding
told me that before!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:14.550
It looks like this work's not for you.

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:16.630
I'll let you handle the inside.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.520
That sounds good.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.710
This is inkredible. You
have a stage inside.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.500
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.770
How absurd can you get?!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.640
It's the real one.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:35.620
It really is the real one.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.090
Won't you just call me "Squid Girl"?

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.720
Who's that?

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:40.460
Who's who?

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:41.910
What?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:42.840
Is something happening?

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.480
Everybody's looking at me.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:51.570
I can't disappoint them now.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.450
I have to do something...

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.100
That's it!

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.320
I am going to spit squid ink now.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.220
It feels good when they cheer.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:08.300
Now I'll walk on my tentacles.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.160
I am going to glow.

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.030
Thank you!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.460
You've gotten quite used to
talking, in just one day.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.670
Yes, thank you.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:28.340
We're closing up, so you can
get changed. Good work.

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:31.140
I wonder if Squid Girl's
doing okay, too.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.760
We're open in the evening,
too, so...

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.600
Then I'll walk you over there
and check on Squid Girl.

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:40.830
There are people in front
of our place...

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:43.780
Yeah, what's with that crowd?

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:55.050
It's a drum god!

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:58.620
What is with this intense
atmosphere?

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:03.050
You see? I can utilize Squid
Girl better than you.

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:09.390
I hate my non-invasion
related squid talents!

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:44.080
Hi! I'm Cindy Campbell.

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.060
How are you doing?

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:46.230
Next time:

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:47.670
Aren't you a squiddle
under the weather?

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:49.250
Ink that a new ability?

00:23:49.250 --> 00:23:50.830
Squidn't you bring an umbrella?

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:54.330
Understood? An alien is right next to you!
